er and drill wells and do raincatch for irrigation.  \n\nThose that hate us, can start a new thing in Wakanda.  Bye, faglecia!  Have fun developing super advanced afro-technology.\n\nThe other option and working example of this is *Liberland*, which is already a sovereign microstate on the border of Serbia and Croatia, inspired by Jeff Berwicks (no friend of Trump's) *Anarchopulcho*.  They are a anarchist commune.  For 5k I was offered to be the north carolina state ambassador of Liberland, when really I was just inquiring about it.  Isn't that funny?  I'd rather buy solana, or blipcoin, and a citizenship to *Asguardia*, the first free space civilization, and become a 'belter'. That's a joke you guys.  I mean, it's *real* but also my thing is a joke.  Joke like Biden.\n\nThis wakanda thing...i've been thinking about it for a whole 5 minutes.  I think it might just work.\n\n(EDIT: this is flaired shitpost, but it might not BE a shitpost.  Jury's still out.  What are your thoughts fellow pedes?)", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1789659952427, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SubmarineGuy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "We (US / Trump) should buy a chunk of inexpensive African land, call it Wakanda, and then offer free citizenship and $5000US (5 million Wakandan Nubians) to those that leave.  Caveat, they have to renounce their US Citizenship", "last_comment_created": 1789660762169, "content": "<p>It's not a fraud.</p>\n<p>Create a real sovereign microstate called <em>Wakanda</em>.  Real State Department / Embassy.  Democratic Republic.  Copypaste the US Constitution.  Promised USAID to DIRECTLY PAY contractors to fly over and drill wells and do raincatch for irrigation.</p>\n<p>Those that hate us, can start a new thing in Wakanda.  Bye, faglecia!  Have fun developing super advanced afro-technology.</p>\n<p>The other option and working example of this is <em>Liberland</em>, which is already a sovereign microstate on the border of Serbia and Croatia, inspired by Jeff Berwicks (no friend of Trump's) <em>Anarchopulcho</em>.  They are a anarchist commune.  For 5k I was offered to be the north carolina state ambassador of Liberland, when really I was just inquiring about it.  Isn't that funny?  I'd rather buy solana, or blipcoin, and a citizenship to <em>Asguardia</em>, the first free space civilization, and become a 'belter'. That's a joke you guys.  I mean, it's <em>real</em> but also my thing is a joke.  Joke like Biden.</p>\n<p>This wakanda thing...i've been thinking about it for a whole 5 minutes.  I think it might just work.</p>\n<p>(EDIT: this is flaired shitpost, but it might not BE a shitpost.  Jury's still out.  What are your thoughts fellow pedes?)</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 10, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83d\udca9\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0SHITPOST\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\udca9", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2100255351857639455", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVHajKav", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 238, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8839409, "raw_content": "", "author": "bleeje", "created": 1789595626461, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SS-Kanyewaffen", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVHajKav.png", "removal_so